flowchart TD
    CALL["Model requests a tool call"] --> AD["Advertised-tool allowlist"]
    AD -->|not advertised| REJECT["Rejected with synthetic result + telemetry"]
    AD -->|advertised| SCOPE["Authorization scope check"]
    SCOPE -->|unauthorized| FAILCLOSED["Fail closed"]
    SCOPE -->|authorized| URL["URL safety filter"]
    URL -->|blocked| BLOCK["Blocked"]
    URL -->|allowed| ISO["Isolated per-tool execution with timeout"]
    ISO --> EXEC["Tool implementations"]
    EXEC --> EXT["External sources"]
    EXT --> RESULT["Normalized result returned to loop"]
    ISO -->|crash or timeout| CONTAINED["Contained; loop continues or finishes"]
